        "id": "precedence",
        "heading": "Priority and conflicts",
        "text": "When several active mods provide the same path, their priority determines the result. Interpret the order displayed by the mod manager according to its own documentation: “loaded after” and “greater priority” may describe opposite directions of that list. To identify the selected source, disable candidates one at a time or substitute an unmistakable test asset. Do not rename it during the test; the purpose is to investigate one exact resource name."
