        "text": "- fixed · lines 3361–3364: Applied fixes to ERM constants (Era Erm Framework mod): Fixed constant name: MON_SUPREMEARCHANGEL => MON_SUPREME_ARCHANGEL. Fixed constant MON_LA… Applied fixes to ERM constants (Era Erm Framework mod): Fixed constant name: MON_SUPREMEARCHANGEL => MON_SUPREME_ARCHANGEL. Fixed constant MON_LAST_WOG => 196 instead of 197. Credits: igrik. Fixed primary skills constants. Credits: Algor. Related pages: [Framework functions](../framework/functions/)"
