        "text": "- fixed · lines 3427–3428: HE:P without 4-th parameter now works as in WoG 3.58f for compatibility reasons. If hero belongs to current player, teleport sound is played and … HE:P without 4-th parameter now works as in WoG 3.58f for compatibility reasons. If hero belongs to current player, teleport sound is played and screen redrawn. Otherwise teleportation is silent without visual update. Related pages: [Heroes (HE)](../receivers/he/)"
