        "text": "+ added · lines 3904–3905: VR:M2 does not store token index in global variable anymore. Token index, that was ignored earlier, works now as expected. Token delimiters are [… VR:M2 does not store token index in global variable anymore. Token index, that was ignored earlier, works now as expected. Token delimiters are [#1..#31, ' ', ',', '.']. Don't use for huge text, because performance is O(n^2), where n is tokens number. Related pages: [Variables and expressions (VR)](../receivers/vr/)"
