    "text": "Purpose The Player Bits group from the supplied Framework. Names and values below correspond to !#DC definitions in the supplied files. Use a constant as (NAME) in ERM; it does not allocate a variable. Values Constant Value PLAYER_BIT_RED 1 PLAYER_BIT_BLUE 2 PLAYER_BIT_TAN 4 PLAYER_BIT_GREEN 8 PLAYER_BIT_ORANGE 16 PLAYER_BIT_PURPLE 32 PLAYER_BIT_TEAL 64 PLAYER_BIT_PINK 128 All groups Constant catalog · Variables",
