        "text": "Note: for the Force field for the initial cell (bottom), the game sets the value $=35 (1+2+32), and for the rest - $=34 (2+32). The same goes for all obstacles set by the team. BF:O, in which the initial cell will have $=3 (1+2), and all others will have $=2 (when the obstacle occupies more than 1 cell)."
