    "text": "Receiver CB Receiver CB (creature banks) !!CB#1/#2/#3:XXXX; - setting the parameters of the bank (storage) of creatures in X Y L. Creature Bank – type 16. You can give an unlimited number of artifacts as a reward, except for scrolls with spells. If you put a scroll as a reward, the game will crash. This receiver also works for Decrepit Ship (type 24), Dragon Utopia (type 25), Crypt (type 84), Shipwreck (type 85) (see. objects). See also: table creature storage A Bonus – artifact A1/$ - check/get the number of artifacts in the bonus table (cannot be installed!) A2/#/$ - set/check/get artifact $ in position # (0...) in the bonus table A3/$ - add artifact $ to the end of the bonus table A4/$ - remove artifact in position $ (0...) in the bonus table. G#1/$2/$3 Set/check/get security guards in slot #1 (0..6), type $2 and quantity $3. Additionally (show) The creatures are located like this: 3 6 0 5 [X] 4 2 1 Moreover, even if you have configured any creatures in slots 0..4 inclusive, then slots 5 and 6 will be occupied by spearmen. To avoid this, use a guard creature value of -1 with a count of 0 for slots 5 and 6. It is worth noting that it is possible to change the type of protection of treasuries directly by making changes to the game memory. Here is a list of memory addresses and their default values (provided by Igor): (show) !!UN:C6750880/1/94; Cyclops Vault !!UN:C6750900/1/16; Treasury of the Dwarves !!UN:C6750920/1/4; Griffin Conservatory !!UN:C6751108/1/12; Conservatory of Griffins award - Angels !!UN:C6750940/1/42; Sanctuary of Demons !!UN:C6750960/1/76; Medusa Warehouses !!UN:C6750980/1/38; Nag Bank !!UN:C6751000/1/104; Hive Zmiev !!UN:C6751124/1/108; Hive of the Wyrm Reward - Wyverns !!UN:C6751020/1/115; Derelict Ship (Water Elemental) !!UN:C6751040/1/60; Shipwreck (Guardians) Crypt !!UN:C6751060/1/56; Corpse !!UN:C6751064/1/58; Zombie !!UN:C6751068/1/60; Wight !!UN:C6751072/1/62; Vampire Dragon Utopia !!UN:C6751080/1/26; Green dragon !!UN:C6751084/1/82; Red Dragon !!UN:C6751088/1/27; golden dragon !!UN:C6751092/1/83; Black Dragon M$1/$2 Set/check/get bonus creatures like $1 and quantity $2 (1..127). To remove bonus creature, set type to -1 and quantity to 0. R#1/$2 Set/check/get a resource bonus type #1 and quantity $2. you you can install all 7 resources. T$ Set/check/get whether the bank is visited (1) or not (0). Comment (show) If you enable the store again (set this command to 0), you need to set at least one guard, otherwise, the next hero who visits this vault will receive the entire reward without a battle. V$ Set/check/get a word “Visited” for player $. Comment (show) This is a beaten mask, for example, if the vault was visited by blue, red and green, and it was robbed by blue at once, $ will be equal to 2(blue)+1(red)+8(green)=11. These players will have an inscription on their home that it has been visited. Also, if the player visited the vault, but did not attack, its bits will still be included in the value edited by this option, and the number of guards will be indicated to the player in the tooltip. Related reference OB Related commands and tables Game object table · Game object table · Creature banks · Artifact table · Creature table · Resources · Player colors",
