        "text": "!!OW:XXXX; - this receiver can apply actions to a specific player. Use this command to apply actions to the player, such as setting resources, commands, number of heroes controlled by the player, and the time that a player can live without a town. If you want to give or take money from a player, you can use a simplified syntax: !!OW../6/d100; – give 100 gold !!OW../6/d-100; – pick up 100 gold"
