    "text": "Receiver QW Receiver QW (magazine) !!QW:XXXX; - task log controller. Allows you to add, delete or change text in the new Journal (papyrus). It is simply an addition to what already exists, and not replaces the original one. To view your journal, the player must click on the “Journal” button in the window hero. First the papyrus will be shown (if not empty), and then, after clicking \"OK\", standard quest log. The magazine is not replaced, but supplemented. You can use it not only for quests, but also for any text: give a hint, or make some kind of joke. A#1/#2/#3/$4 Allows you to add, change or delete a line in the Journal. #1 – unique number, set to this line #2 – hero number -1 – current -2 – any (all heroes) #3 – owner -1 – current -2 – any (all players) $4 – number z-variable with text -1 – delete this text (check/set/get) Related commands and tables Hero table · Player colors",
