        "text": "Instructions prefixed with !# run when a new map is initialized. !?PI; / !?FU(OnAfterErmInstructions); follows the instructions. It is not a handler for every saved-game load: use !?GM0; / !?FU(OnAfterLoadGame); for that event. Saved gameplay state and temporary process resources require different restoration strategies; a memory address must not be assumed valid after restarting the process."
