        "heading": "Checking changes",
        "text": "Use a separate test map and check new-game initialization, save/load, and repeated event execution. Battle code also needs checks for quick combat, AI, and multiplayer. For an ERM error, first check the header, semicolons, paired if/re and en blocks, identifier ranges, and whether the event context is available. Syntax · Compatibility"
