        "text": "See also: event OnCombatRound Comment: variable v997 stores the number of the current round. A new round starts between triggers !?BG0 and !?BG1. The starting rounds (!?BR-1 and !?BR0) are in the \"dark\" zone and you cannot show any message until you can do something. Example: !?BR; a new round has started !!VRv5000:Sv997; store the round number in v5000 for other needs"
