        "text": "!?MP; - management of mp3 files. Trigger fires whenever the game or ERM/Lua calls a function ChangeMp3Theme. In a trigger, function parameters can be changed using !!MP:S, and the default response to the function (on/off) using !!MP:R. Comment: for ERA parameter \"UseOnlyOneCpuCore\" in the file heroes3.ini the default is 0, which allows you to run HD mod in modes with high processor load. Please note that it is better to remove all ID3 tags from the mp3 to avoid possible gaming problems."
