    "text": "Trigger TM Trigger TM (timer) !?TM#; - trigger for the timer code. Triggers when timer number # is triggered. # = timer number (1..100) To set the timer use receiver !!TM. When it fires Fires for timer 1..100 previously configured with the TM receiver. Declaration !?TM#; Limitations and ordering OnEveryDay fires before regular timers and needs no TM setup. Declaring !?TM does not enable the timer. Related reference Event catalog · Conditions · Functions Related commands and tables Game timers (TM)",
