        "text": "+ added · lines 263–264: Introduced another directory for ERM global library scripts: \"Data/s/lib_end\". Scripts from this directory will be loaded after all other map/glo… Introduced another directory for ERM global library scripts: \"Data/s/lib_end\". Scripts from this directory will be loaded after all other map/global/library scripts. Likewise \"lib\" directory, these scripts do not depend on UN:P5 WoG option state. Связанные страницы: [Общие игровые операции (UN)](../receivers/un/) · [Введение в ERM](../start/)"
