        "text": "+ added · lines 687–687: Improved exceptions tolerance for ERM engine (triggers and commands). ERM memory clean up is performed in case of exception, allowing to reuse ER… Improved exceptions tolerance for ERM engine (triggers and commands). ERM memory clean up is performed in case of exception, allowing to reuse ERM engine later after recovery. Exceptions may be used, for instance, to trigger fast quit from deeply nested dialogs."
