        "text": "+ added · lines 689–689: Improved crash/exception handling. HD and WoG handlers are not called at all. Era's handler is called only once. Crash reports become more stable… Improved crash/exception handling. HD and WoG handlers are not called at all. Era's handler is called only once. Crash reports become more stable and accurate. Previosly multiple exception could take place and override the same logs."
