        "text": "+ added · lines 1718–1727: Added new ERM command VR:B. It converts any number to boolean (1 or 0). Any non-zero value becomes 1. Example: !!OW:R(CURRENT_PLAYER)/(RES_GOLD)/… Added new ERM command VR:B. It converts any number to boolean (1 or 0). Any non-zero value becomes 1. Example: !!OW:R(CURRENT_PLAYER)/(RES_GOLD)/?(goldAmount:y); !!VR(hasGold:y):S(goldAmount) B; now hasGold = (TRUE) or (FALSE) !!if&(hasGold)=(TRUE); !!IF:M^I know you have some gold in your pockets!^; !!en; Связанные страницы: [Игроки (OW)](../receivers/ow/) · [Переменные и выражения (VR)](../receivers/vr/) · [Флаги, сообщения и выбор (IF)](../receivers/if/)"
