        "text": "+ added · lines 2481–2493: Improved Heroes 3 complex dialogs support. Credits: Berserker, igrik. IF:N(msgType)/^text^[/?result/(textAlignment)/(preselectedPicId)/(selectabl… Improved Heroes 3 complex dialogs support. Credits: Berserker, igrik. IF:N(msgType)/^text^[/?result/(textAlignment)/(preselectedPicId)/(selectablePicsMask)]. selectablePicsMask - bit mask of pictures, allowed for selection. Default value is -1 (all pictures). To make the first and the forth pictures selectable only specify mask 1 ^ 0 + 1 ^ 3 = 1 + 8 = 9. This setting allows some pictures to act as decoration only and the others to act as selectable items. Example: ; Let's display selection of two army types in the center and two resource costs at the edges. ; Monster pictures will be selectable, resource pictures will not be selectable. !!FU(ConstructBitMask):P(DLG_RESULT_PIC_2)/(DLG_RESULT_PIC_3)/?(selectablePicsMask:y); !!IF:N(PIC_TYPE_RES_CRYSTAL)/100/(PIC_TYPE_MONSTER)/(MON_CYCLOPS)/(PIC_TYPE_MONSTER)/(MON_EFREETI)/(PIC_TYPE_RES_SULFUR)/100; !!IF:N(MSG_TYPE_CHOOSE_PIC)/^What army do you want to call?^/?(choice:y)/(TEXT_ALIGN_CENTER)/(DLG_NO_SELECTION)/(selectablePicsMask); Связанные страницы: [Вызовы функций (FU)](../receivers/fu/) · [Флаги, сообщения и выбор (IF)](../receivers/if/) · [Функции Framework](../framework/functions/)"
