        "text": "+ added · lines 2931–2937: IF:N and IF:Q dialogs with pictures now support special picture type flag: (PIC_TYPE_FLAG_DISPLAY_ZEROS). If it's set, zero quantities (resources… IF:N and IF:Q dialogs with pictures now support special picture type flag: (PIC_TYPE_FLAG_DISPLAY_ZEROS). If it's set, zero quantities (resources, monsters, experience, etc) will be displayed like \"0 Archangels\" instead of \"Archangels\" or empty caption. Example: !!VR(picType:y):S(PIC_TYPE_EXPERIENCE) |(PIC_TYPE_FLAG_DISPLAY_ZEROS); !!VR(picSubtype:y):S0; !!IF:Q2/(picType)/(picSubtype)/(MSG_TYPE_QUESTION)/^Wanna nothing?^; Связанные страницы: [Переменные и выражения (VR)](../receivers/vr/) · [Флаги, сообщения и выбор (IF)](../receivers/if/)"
