        "id": "era3-v-3-0-5-l3170",
        "heading": "",
        "text": "+ added · lines 3170–3181: Added possibility to query SN:M arrays information. !!SN:M#1/(?)$2/(?)$3/?($4)[/?$5]; #1 - array ID $2 - items count $3 - items type (0 - integer… Added possibility to query SN:M arrays information. !!SN:M#1/(?)$2/(?)$3/?($4)[/?$5]; #1 - array ID $2 - items count $3 - items type (0 - integers, 1 - strings) $4 - items storage type (-1 - trigger local, 0 - temporary, 1 - with savegame stored contents) $5 - unsafe temporary address of array first item in memory At least single #2..#4 parameter should use GET syntax. SET-syntax parameters are ignored in this case. Example: !!SN:M(array)/d/?(itemsType:y)/d; check if it's array of integers or strings !!if&(itemsType)=(M_INT):; ... Связанные страницы: [Средства ERA, память и звук (SN)](../receivers/sn/)"
