        "text": "+ added · lines 3183–3190: Added new constants to \"Era Erm Framework\" mod: - TOWN_XXX constants for each town type in the game. - CALLCONV_XXX constants for possible SN:E c… Added new constants to \"Era Erm Framework\" mod: - TOWN_XXX constants for each town type in the game. - CALLCONV_XXX constants for possible SN:E calling conventions. - BATTLE_XXX constants for battle sides and stack limits. - FLOAT_INF and FLOAT_NEG_INF, representing infinity values for float numbers. Usage: !!VR(inf:e):C(FLOAT_INF); Assign positive infinity to (inf) variable without type conversion !!IF&(someValue)=(inf):M^Value is too big^; Check some e-var for positive infinity Связанные страницы: [Переменные и выражения (VR)](../receivers/vr/) · [Флаги, сообщения и выбор (IF)](../receivers/if/) · [Средства ERA, память и звук (SN)](../receivers/sn/) · [Функции Framework](../framework/functions/)"
