        "id": "era3-v-3-0-4-l3387",
        "heading": "",
        "text": "+ added · lines 3387–3389: Improved ERM stability. Now all non-specified parameters are treated as 0 in X# syntax and ignored in X$ syntax. As a result, !!DL:A without the … Improved ERM stability. Now all non-specified parameters are treated as 0 in X# syntax and ignored in X$ syntax. As a result, !!DL:A without the 4-th parameter will not randomly crash anymore and !!TR may be used with any number of parameters, while exactly 8 were required previously. Note, that many ERM commands still require exact number of obligatory parameters. Связанные страницы: [Пользовательские диалоги (DL)](../receivers/dl/) · [Клетки карты (TR)](../receivers/tr/)"
