        "text": "+ added · lines 3393–3395: Included updated \"wog native dialogs\" plugin by igrik. From now plugins exports function __cdecl int UseWin32InputControl (int newState). The fun… Included updated \"wog native dialogs\" plugin by igrik. From now plugins exports function __cdecl int UseWin32InputControl (int newState). The function allows to switch between Heroes 3 native input control and Windows input control. The latter allows to input Asian and '{', '}' characters. Mode can be switched any time even using ERM. UseWin32InputControl returns previous state."
