        "text": "+ added · lines 3420–3425: Added OnBeforeBattleStackTurn event. It occurs right before OnBattleRegenerationPhase event. Parameters: Stack ID (0..41). Change the first param… Added OnBeforeBattleStackTurn event. It occurs right before OnBattleRegenerationPhase event. Parameters: Stack ID (0..41). Change the first parameter to give turn to another stack. Note, that similar OnBattleStackObtainsTurn event occurs when stack becomes active and is not related to regeneration phase at all. Normally OnBattleStackObtainsTurn occurs after OnBattleRegenerationPhase but may also be triggered manually by calling 464F10 (THISCALL, ecx = CombatManager, Side 0..1, StackInd 0..20). Связанные страницы: [Перед ходом стека (OnBeforeBattleStackTurn)](../triggers/onbeforebattlestackturn/) · [События Framework](../framework/events/) · [Передача хода стеку (OnBattleStackObtainsTurn)](../triggers/onbattlestackobtainsturn/) · [Триггеры и события ERM](../triggers/)"
