        "text": "+ added · lines 3992–3993: Rewritten HE:X command to accept any number of parameters and understand any d-modifiers. Example: !!HE-1:X0/27 Xd1; become master of gold dragon… Rewritten HE:X command to accept any number of parameters and understand any d-modifiers. Example: !!HE-1:X0/27 Xd1; become master of gold dragons Связанные страницы: [Герои (HE)](../receivers/he/)"
