        "text": "+ added · lines 4074–4084: Added new event \"OnDetermineMonInfoDlgUpgrade\", occured, when game determines wether to show upgrade button in monster info dialog. Parameters: M… Added new event \"OnDetermineMonInfoDlgUpgrade\", occured, when game determines wether to show upgrade button in monster info dialog. Parameters: MonType, UpgradedType or -1, Town ID or -1, Hero ID or -1. -1 for UpgradedType means no upgrade button (because of wrong town type or appropriate building being not built, or monster having no upgrade). You can change this value to allow universal Jelu-like behavior or any upgrade system. Example: ZVSE2 !?FU(OnDetermineMonInfoDlgUpgrade); !#VA(monType:x) (upgType:x) (town:x) (hero:x); !!VR(upgType):S(MON_GOLD_DRAGON); allow upgrade anything into Gold Dragons Связанные страницы: [Обработчик функции (FU)](../triggers/fu/) · [Переменные и выражения (VR)](../receivers/vr/) · [Выбор улучшения существа (OnDetermineMonInfoDlgUpgrade)](../triggers/ondeterminemoninfodlgupgrade/) · [События Framework](../framework/events/) · [Функции Framework](../framework/functions/) · [Триггеры и события ERM](../triggers/) · [Синтаксис ERM: ZVSE и ZVSE2](../syntax/)"
